---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import '../../styles/legal.css';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy — wArcxs" description="Privacy Policy for wArcxs.">
  <div class="legal">
    <header class="ltop">
      <a class="wm" href="/"><span class="lm">wArcxs</span></a>
      <a class="back" href="/">← Back</a>
    </header>
    <main class="lmain">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="upd">Last updated: July 2026</p>

      <p>This policy explains what wArcxs ("we") collects when you use our products and services — including
        wArcxs, wArcxs Licenses and any other product we offer — why, and who we share it with. We keep it to
        what the Services need.</p>

      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Account</strong> — your email and basic profile from Google sign-in, and a Discord ID if you link
          one.</li>
        <li><strong>Access request</strong> — the answers you give in a request form, where a product is gated.</li>
        <li><strong>Billing</strong> — handled by Stripe. We store your Stripe customer/subscription identifiers, not
          your card details.</li>
        <li><strong>Usage & service data</strong> — the records each product needs to run: for example, licenses,
          seats, token balances and job records; and, for licensing, the license keys, products and activation data
          (such as machine fingerprints and IPs) used to validate keys.</li>
        <li><strong>Files you submit</strong> — where a product processes uploads (for example, JARs sent to Lock
          Master), they are uploaded to storage and processed to produce a result, then <strong>not retained</strong>
          beyond what's needed to deliver the job. We do not execute your code.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>How we use it</h2>
      <p>To provide and secure the Services: authenticate you, run jobs and validations, manage licenses and billing,
        send account and support emails, and prevent abuse.</p>

      <h2>Who we share it with</h2>
      <p>We use a small set of processors to run the Services:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Google</strong> — sign-in (authentication) and, for some products, the compute that runs jobs
          (Google Cloud Run).</li>
        <li><strong>Stripe</strong> — payments and subscription management.</li>
        <li><strong>Cloudflare</strong> — DNS, email routing, and the object storage (R2) that uploaded and produced
          files pass through.</li>
        <li><strong>Resend</strong> — transactional email delivery.</li>
        <li><strong>Our hosting provider</strong> — a virtual private server that runs the backends and databases (your
          account, licenses, service and job records).</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We don't sell your data. We only disclose it when required by law.</p>

      <h2>Cookies</h2>
      <p>We use a single essential cookie to keep you signed in (an <code>HttpOnly</code> session cookie), plus a small
        non-sensitive flag in your browser's local storage to remember you're logged in. We don't use tracking or
        advertising cookies.</p>

      <h2>Retention</h2>
      <p>We keep account, billing and service records for as long as you have an account and as required for
        legal/accounting purposes. Files you submit for processing are not retained beyond delivery of the job.</p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>You can request access to, correction of, or deletion of your personal data. Email us and we'll handle it.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Privacy questions or requests: <a href="mailto:hello@warcxs.com">hello@warcxs.com</a>.</p>
    </main>
    <footer class="lfoot">
      <span>2026 wArcxs &mdash; &copy; All rights reserved</span>
      <nav><a href="/about">About</a><a href="/legal/terms">Terms</a><a href="/legal/privacy">Privacy</a><a href="/legal/refunds">Refunds</a></nav>
    </footer>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
